From 5b2db2f6c183731aab446cb385388d639ef78f62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@localhost>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:55:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Compile VU0 microprograms with the VU1 program compiler

Code images are recorded as vu0-<hash>.code (4 KiB) beside the VU1 ones;
routines carry their unit's code size and code mask, the generator leaves
VU0's reserved EFU, MFP and XGKICK instructions to the interpreter, and a
drained VU0 at a VCALLMS entry runs its compiled routine.
